# Design skills

For ANY UI change, first read these files, in order, and follow them:

1. `.claude/skills/design-taste-frontend/SKILL.md`
2. `.claude/skills/unslop/SKILL.md`
3. `.claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/SKILL.md`

UI change means layout, styling, copy on screen, components, motion, or anything a person sees in the app.
